#: data/interfaces/xfpm-settings.ui:625
msgid ""
"This is the mechanism by which applications send inhibit requests to "
"xfce4-power-manager, such as when you're watching a video in a web browser. "
"These applications may fail to send an un-inhibit request afterward, so you "
"may want to disable this if you encounter recurring issues."
msgstr "Aplikazioek xfce4-power-manager-i inhibizio-eskaerak bidaltzeko erabiltzen duten mekanismoa da, adibidez web-nabigatzaile batean bideo bat ikusten ari zarenean. Baliteke aplikazio horiek ondoren inhibizioa kentzeko eskaerarik ez bidaltzea; beraz, arazoak behin eta berriz gertatzen badira, agian desgaitu nahiko duzu."

