#, c-format
msgid ""
"Make sure you set a sufficiently high value here, otherwise the system will "
"trigger its own action before xfce4-power-manager, without being able to "
"prevent it or know exactly when it will do so. The action triggered by the "
"system in this case will be: %s."
msgstr "Ziurtatu hemen balio nahikoa altua ezartzen duzula; bestela, sistemak bere ekintza abiaraziko du xfce4-power-manager-ek baino lehen, hori eragotzi ezin izanda eta noiz egingo duen zehazki jakin gabe. Kasu horretan sistemak abiaraziko duen ekintza hau izango da: %s."

