#: data/appdata/org.xfce.PowerManager.appdata.xml.in:7
msgid "Xfce power manager"
msgstr "Xfce energia-kudeatzailea"

#: data/appdata/org.xfce.PowerManager.appdata.xml.in:8
msgid "Manage and reduce power consumption of computer and devices"
msgstr "Kudeatu eta murriztu ordenagailuaren eta gailuen energia-kontsumoa"

#: data/appdata/org.xfce.PowerManager.appdata.xml.in:11
msgid ""
"Xfce power manager manages the power sources on the computer and the devices"
" that can be controlled to reduce their power consumption (such as LCD "
"brightness level, monitor sleep, CPU frequency scaling)."
msgstr "Xfce energia-kudeatzaileak ordenagailuko energia-iturriak kudeatzen ditu, baita energia-kontsumoa murrizteko kontrola daitezkeen gailuak ere (adibidez, LCDaren distira-maila, monitorea lotan jartzea, PUZaren maiztasun-eskalatzea)."

#: data/appdata/org.xfce.PowerManager.appdata.xml.in:16
msgid ""
"In addition, Xfce power manager provides a set of freedesktop-compliant DBus"
" interfaces to inform other applications about current power level so that "
"they can adjust their power consumption, and it provides the inhibit "
"interface which allows applications to prevent automatic sleep actions via "
"the power manager; as an example, the operating system’s package manager "
"should make use of this interface while it is performing update operations."
msgstr "Gainera, Xfce energia-kudeatzaileak freedesktop-ekin bateragarriak diren DBus interfaze batzuk eskaintzen ditu beste aplikazioei uneko energia-mailaren berri emateko, haien energia-kontsumoa doitu dezaten. Inhibizio-interfazea ere eskaintzen du, aplikazioek energia-kudeatzailearen bidez lo-ekintza automatikoak eragotz ditzaten; adibidez, sistema eragilearen pakete-kudeatzaileak interfaze hori erabili beharko luke eguneratze-eragiketak egiten ari den bitartean."

#: data/appdata/org.xfce.PowerManager.appdata.xml.in:23
msgid ""
"Xfce power manager also provides a plugin for the Xfce and LXDE panels to "
"control LCD brightness levels and to monitor battery and device charge "
"levels."
msgstr "Xfce energia-kudeatzaileak Xfce eta LXDE paneletarako plugin bat ere eskaintzen du, LCDaren distira-mailak kontrolatzeko eta bateriaren eta gailuen karga-mailak monitorizatzeko."

#: data/appdata/org.xfce.PowerManager.appdata.xml.in:34
msgid "Screenshot of the Xfce Power Manager User Interface"
msgstr "Xfce energia-kudeatzailearen erabiltzaile-interfazearen pantaila-argazkia"
